# React Frontend Rules

- Use React Router with `/ui` base path for routing
- Use Tailwind CSS + Radix UI components for styling
- Implement proper loading states and error boundaries
- Use React.memo, useMemo, useCallback judiciously for performance
- Follow existing collapsible sidebar pattern
- Keep components accessible with proper ARIA labels
- Use dynamic imports for code splitting large components
